  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/Imgs/logo.png\" width=\"625\" height=\"195\"></div>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/Imgs/strip.png\" width=\"900\"></p>\n<h3>此模组为每种木材类型添加了木制工具！</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>云杉木</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/spruce_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>白桦木</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/birch_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>丛林木</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/jungle_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>金合欢木</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/acacia_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>深色橡木</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/dark_oak_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红树木</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/mangrove_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>樱桃木</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/cherry_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>竹</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/bamboo_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>绯红菌</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/crimson_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>诡异菌</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/warped_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4>是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-crafting-tables-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多合成台</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-chest-variants-lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多箱子变体</a> 的绝佳互补模组</h4>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/Quad/main/requireQuad.png\" width=\"190\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/Imgs/strip.png\" width=\"900\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:none\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=555555&labelColor=ff0000&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Subaka_\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:none\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=555555&labelColor=ff0000&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wooden-tool-variants\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:none\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=555555&labelColor=ff0000&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"162\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252f.subaka%252fmods\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:none\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=555555&labelColor=ff0000&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"148\"> </a></p>",
